<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 JHN Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">3 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Kadatu ya Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya kadatu ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya kadatu tsayandikighwa na mtumighwa Yohane mne miyaka ya tisini kulawa Yesu helekighwe, Yohane ng'alongile bae ka yeye iye iyandike, ila kekema imwenyegho mbala (3 Yohane 1:1). Kuya kotenda pfipfo mne (2 Yohane 1:1) Yotogholighwa ka Yohane hayang'ali yokala Efeso tsakandika Imbuli Inoghile, na tsibaluwa tsingi ndatu, Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso, ya Keli na aino ya Kadatu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane tsakamwandikila ibaluwa ino imunu we Imulungu iyakemighwe Gayo. Komkema Gayo sale yake, na komlaghitsa awatendele uluso Wakiristu wangi iwobita mna isi yawo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:1 Yohane koitambula ibaluwa yake.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:2-8 komghuma Gayo ghumoyo na komlaghitsa aghendelele na uluso.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:9-12 kolonga mbuli tsa iwanu wangi weli, Diyotelefe na Demetiliyo.</para>
  <para style="io">Isua ya 1:13-14 komalitsila ibaluwa yake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Nene imbala nokwandikila ghweghwe Gayo, yanikunoghela mna ukweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Sale yangu, nokulombela pfinu pfako pfighende ghoya na uwe mghima, ka muhe wako pfaughendelela ghoya. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Tsandeng'elela ng'ani hanihulike ndughu wangi iwatsile hano na kunongela pfaukindilisa ukweli na pfaughendelela kukala mne ukweli. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Kuduhu ichinu ichinideng'elesa ng'ani kubita kuhulika ka wanangu wokala mne ukweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuwasang'anila wandughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Sale yangu, ghweghwe kwa wakutogholighwa mne sang'ano tsuwasang'anila wandughu, ghendoghendo kwa wahenza. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Iwanu awo walilongela kanisa lya hano mbuli tse unoghelo wako. Kutsotenda ghoya ung'awapfila waghendelele ne ghumwanza ghwawo kwa inzila iimnoghela Imulungu. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Mana wakwandusa ghumwanza ghwawo mne ukumsang'anila Kiristu bila kubokela chinu kulawa kwe iwanu ing'awommanya Imulungu. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Twetwe Wakiristu twobamighwa kuwapfila iwanu ka wano, ili tusang'ane nawo kwaajili ye ukweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diyotelefe na Demetiliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Tsanilyandikila ibaluwa kanisa, lekeni Diyotelefe, iyobama yawe chilongotsi, kolema ghendo kutuhulikitsa. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Ning'atsa nitsogheka mwatsi ghose ghayatendile, aghala ghehile ghayatulongile na ghayotubangitsila! Kuya yeye kolemagha kuwabokela wandughu wayetu, pfipfila kowaghoma awala iwobama kuwabokela, na kowawinga kulawa mne kanisa.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Sale yangu, uleke kuwinza ghehile, ila ughawinze ghanoghile. Imunu wowose iyotenda ghanoghile kolawa kwe Imulungu. Na imunu wowose iyotenda ghehile ng'amwonile bae Imulungu.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Iwanu wose wolonga ghoya mbuli tsa Demetiriyo, na ukweli nawo wolonga pfipfo. Pfipfila twetwe wose twolonga pfinoghile mbuli tsake, naghwe kwomanya ka twolongesa.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndamso tsa usighilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Tsang'ala ne tsimbuli nyingi tsa kuwalongela, lekeni sibama bae kukwandikila. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Nololela kukwona sambi, kuya tutsolonga chihanga kwa chihanga.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Ukale tseghamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Sale tsetu iwali hano wokulamsa. Kuya walamse sale tsetu wose iwali ako, chila munu.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>